      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## SeedVR2 7B upscale\n\nLoad any image (a Klein output, a photo) and it comes back 2x larger, restored in one diffusion step. Colour is matched to the source in LAB space.\n\n### Files (under `/data/models/`)\n\n| Folder | File | Size |\n|---|---|---|\n| diffusion_models | seedvr2_7b_int8_convrot.safetensors | 8.3 GB |\n| vae | seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors | 0.5 GB |\n\nFrom [Comfy-Org/SeedVR2](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2).\n\n### Knobs\n- Scale: 2x of a 1 to 4 MP image is comfortable on 12 GB; 4x of a 1 MP image works but is slow.\n- Faster or less RAM: `seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors` (3.5 GB).\n- Crisper: the `seedvr2_7b_sharp_` variant, which can over-sharpen AI images.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000"
    }
